        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Max Neufeld, Eduard Zahariev, Jacob Fleck, Luise Fleck, Hans Rhoden, Polly Janisch, Grigor Vachkov, Mariana Dimitrova, Velko Kanev, Pavel Popandov\n- Films: The Priest from Kirchfeld, Manly Times\n- Places: Austria, Bulgaria\n- Roles: film director, actor, screenwriter\n\nFacts:\n- Max Neufeld was born on 13 February 1887 and died on 2 December 1967.\n- Max Neufeld was an Austrian film director, actor, and screenwriter.\n- The Austrian silent film The Priest from Kirchfeld was released in 1914.\n- The Priest from Kirchfeld was directed by Jacob Fleck and Luise Fleck.\n- The Priest from Kirchfeld starred Max Neufeld, Hans Rhoden, and Polly Janisch.\n- Eduard Zahariev was born on 1 July 1938 and died on 26 June 1996.\n- Eduard Zahariev was a Bulgarian film director and screenwriter.\n- The Bulgarian drama film Manly Times was released in 1977.\n- Manly Times was directed by Eduard Zahariev.\n- Manly Times starred Grigor Vachkov, Mariana Dimitrova, Velko Kanev, and Pavel Popandov.",
